  "prompt": "Repaint this existing Orange SMP Kitchen item as a native 16x16 vanilla Minecraft item sprite, matching the pixel density of vanilla items like wheat seeds, sugar and bread. Same subject: A folded ivory seed packet with a vivid red chilli illustration, fresh green stem and three golden seeds. Chunky connected shading and upper-left highlights keep the crop readable in inventory. Keep the original palette and silhouette, simplified to 16x16: clean dark outline, upper-left lighting, 2-3 shade steps per material, no noise or dithering, no letters, transparent background. Drop details that cannot stay legible at 16x16.",
